      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 5.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Hello? Doctor? I was told to to come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.57,
      "end_seconds": 10.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "no problem at all come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.24,
      "end_seconds": 17.33,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "I wanted to to get my face drooping on the right looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.36,
      "end_seconds": 21.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "let me take your readings now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.84,
      "end_seconds": 37.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Alright nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.51,
      "end_seconds": 55.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.8, heart rate 83, blood pressure 123 over 79. And saturation 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.76,
      "end_seconds": 61.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.57,
      "end_seconds": 69.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "that's fine, I'll explain it soon"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.91,
      "end_seconds": 87.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.93,
      "end_seconds": 90.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "For six months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.97,
      "end_seconds": 93.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.29,
      "end_seconds": 107.9,
      "duration_seconds": 12.61,
      "text": "It usually comes with not being able to close my eye. The not being able to close my eye? That's been since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.4,
      "end_seconds": 116.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "Any weakness in the arm or leg, slurred speech or rash in the ear at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.11,
      "end_seconds": 128.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "No, no weakness in the arm or leg, slurred speech or rash in the ear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.8,
      "end_seconds": 130.59,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "Any headache?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.32,
      "end_seconds": 134.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "No um none no headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.85,
      "end_seconds": 139.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.22,
      "end_seconds": 141.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "skin's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.88,
      "end_seconds": 148.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "let's run through your medicines i'll explain everything as we go along"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.09,
      "end_seconds": 163.35,
      "duration_seconds": 11.26,
      "text": "Allopurinol, 100 milligrams, once a day for the gout i'm on metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day for my heart"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.57,
      "end_seconds": 164.52,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.1,
      "end_seconds": 176.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "okay any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.71,
      "end_seconds": 181.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "I have gout i've got heart disease"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.08,
      "end_seconds": 188.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "Ah. Okay, yes, gout is known to us, good to have that clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.69,
      "end_seconds": 202.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.64,
      "end_seconds": 211.24,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "yes, I had two stents put in my heart, three years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.32,
      "end_seconds": 215.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "now some background about your lifestyle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.07,
      "end_seconds": 237.88,
      "duration_seconds": 21.81,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.92,
      "end_seconds": 254.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.66,
      "end_seconds": 258.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "no, I'm not allergic to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.74,
      "end_seconds": 265.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.38,
      "end_seconds": 268.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "does that that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.1,
      "end_seconds": 293.19,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "the whole right side of the face is weak, including the forehead, and the left side is normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.75,
      "end_seconds": 329.23,
      "duration_seconds": 32.48,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. Having listened and examined, I think we're dealing with Bell's palsy at this stage. Let's use prednisolone, 50 milligrams, once a day, ten days. That should help with Bell's palsy. Use eye drops and tape the eye shut at night to protect it. Please don't wait if you get weakness in an arm or leg. That's when to be seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.82,
      "end_seconds": 331.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Yes will do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.46,
      "end_seconds": 335.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Let's plan a check in one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.8,
      "end_seconds": 338.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "that's fine with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.78,
      "end_seconds": 346.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "how would you describe the plan, so so we're on the same page?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.41,
      "end_seconds": 358.13,
      "duration_seconds": 10.72,
      "text": "so, I take the prednisolone, 50 milligrams, once a day and come back in one week is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.98,
      "end_seconds": 364.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Yes exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.01,
      "end_seconds": 369.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}